+// b2436 WNM bit 2 (Deep spec_wnm_1113, SBG's form; wnm1 read .5006). Runtime data flag WNM_TAB[1], read first; 0 = live. When our lead
+// carry (roster order Prism > Vesper > Marcella, not me) claims a group (her posted claim) and stands within 6 of its anchor, and a foe
+// champion is within 8 of her (my sight, wards included), her OWN row (wl2_pull) scales every other group by WNM_K / 1000: the carry's
+// group wins, so she walks to the carry; with that group rejected the order is live's (only lowers rates: the bounds hold).
+#define WNM_BITS 0
+#define WNM_K 10
+inline const volatile int WNM_TAB[3] = { 0x574E4D32, WNM_BITS, WNM_K }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
+#define WNM_ON(b) ((WNM_TAB[1] & (b)) != 0)
 // b2390 WSS (same task). Runtime data flag WSS_TAB[1], read first; 0 = v904. Bit 1: in the heal-first call, when her heal is ready and no
 // mate in heal reach is worth a heal (wl2_heal found none), a seen mate at heal reach + 1 .. WSS_FAR (not recalling, not on our spawn)
 // missing >= 3 x her Focus (a full heal, no overheal; RC C1342) draws one step toward it (before any camp attack), then the heal rule
 // runs again.
 #define WSS_BITS 1
